      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "01"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 5,
      "text": "Premium Wash"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraphs",
      "items": [
        "a car wash service that uses high-quality products and procedures to thoroughly clean the car, both exterior and interior"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "buttons",
      "items": [
        {
          "label": "Read More",
          "href": "https://autospajakarta.com/premium-wash/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "02"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 5,
      "text": "Premium Detailing"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraphs",
      "items": [
        "Experience a complete transformation inside and out. We meticulously restore your exterior paint's flawless gloss and perform a deep interior cleaning, leaving your vehicle looking and feeling brand new"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "buttons",
      "items": [
        {
          "label": "Read More",
          "href": "https://autospajakarta.com/premium-detailing/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "03"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 5,
      "text": "Premium Coating"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraphs",
      "items": [
        "Add years of protection with hydrophobic ceramic coating. Shields against UV rays, dirt, and scratches—making your car easier to clean and stay glossy longer."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "buttons",
      "items": [
        {
          "label": "Read More",
          "href": "https://autospajakarta.com/premium-nano-ceramic-coating/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "04"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 5,
      "text": "Premium 360° PPF"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraphs",
      "items": [
        "Our Premium 360° PPF provides the ultimate armor for your vehicle. We meticulously wrap the entire exterior with a high-gloss, self-healing transparent film, safeguarding your factory paint against rock chips, deep scratches, and harsh elements."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "buttons",
      "items": [
        {
          "label": "Read More",
          "href": "https://autospajakarta.com/service/premium-360-ppf-package/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "05"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 5,
      "text": "Engine & Glass"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraphs",
      "items": [
        "Restore your visibility and under-hood aesthetics. We thoroughly remove stubborn water spots from all windows and meticulously degrease your engine bay, finishing with a premium dressing for a fresh, like-new look."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "buttons",
      "items": [
        {
          "label": "Read More",
          "href": "#0"
        }
      ]
    },
